␀␀␀An entire race - trapped in a box?␀␀␀Sounds like a fairy tale...H   ␀␀␀*␀␀␀It is very real, and I fear our Vizier did␀␀␀this!	␀␀␀N   ␀␀␀$␀␀␀I don't remember anything more. I am'␀␀␀here today only because Aesma found me.G   ␀␀␀␀␀␀I saw you wandering the Wounded#␀␀␀Lands during my travels. I wondered␀␀␀what made you so distressed!N   ␀␀␀(␀␀␀I fear I spent many years in a haze... I␀␀␀know not how many.G   ␀␀␀␀␀␀An interesting story...N   ␀␀␀#␀␀␀And so, do you understand now why I␀␀␀want to stop Saurva?G   ␀␀␀)␀␀␀I said your tale was interesting, I don't*␀␀␀know if I can believe it yet.... I need to␀␀␀think about your words.N   ␀␀␀&␀␀␀I will leave you to do this. Farewell!G   ␀␀␀	␀␀␀Farewell!G   ␀␀␀␀␀␀The woman seems to know much...$␀␀␀But can I trust her fantastic tales?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀GNALv␀␀␀4␀␀␀    ␀␀␀␀␀␀Infos carte    ␀␀␀␀␀␀Infos armée    ␀␀␀␀␀␀Infos terrain    ␀␀␀␀␀␀Caractéristiques actuelles    ␀␀␀␀␀␀Infos unité    ␀␀␀␀␀␀Infos mission    ␀␀␀␀␀␀RÉSULTAT DE LA BATAILLE    ␀␀␀␀␀␀Prévisualisation de la bataille    ␀␀␀␀␀␀Infos général    ␀␀␀␀␀␀Objectifs de mission    ␀␀␀␀␀␀Vue d'ensemble de la carte    ␀␀␀
